OL,3,GNEWSABritish Army chef jailed for
OL,4,Aterror-linked offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FBroadhurst, of Scott Close, Grassmoor,
OL,7,Fwas sentenced to 46 months in prison at
OL,8,FSheffield Crown Court on Wednesday
OL,9,Fafter pleading guilty to possessing
OL,10,Fexplosives and a firearms offence.
